      "content": "hey i'm starting a youtube channel focused on traditional family values and disciplined upbringing. i want to make a video critiquing the 'gentle parenting' trend. can you give me a list of five intellectual/scientific-sounding arguments why gentle parenting is actually detrimental to child development and discipline?",
